-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7aFYNypq1diuu-gpuz4WebyfEn7mXWDFpMmWiw2NgZyw&oe=6A033C65"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "ALVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Play your favorite PCVR games on your Meta Quest, wirelessly.\n\nThis app requires a PC streamer app. You can download the latest release at https://github.com/alvr-org/ALVR/releases\n\nALVR is opensource and community maintained. If you need help or you want to help with development you can join our Discord server at https://discord.gg/ALVR", "short_description": "Air Light Virtual Reality. Stream your PCVR games to your Meta Quest."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/alvr-org/ALVR#privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ALVR Team", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://github.com/alvr-org/ALVR", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1055187466124150"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7674846245912380"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "8574824035865918"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "8574824035865918"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1720290293, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "8574824035865918"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "23997569996546746", "version": "20.14.0"}, "id": "809758320719109", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7674846229245715", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "23997569996546746"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "809758320719109"}]}, "change_log": "* Add Snapdragon Game Super-Resolution support. @Baplar #2808 \n* Add new version popup. @zmerp #2850 #2872 \n* Allow to copy session file from other installations from the launcher. @zmerp #2828\n* Make Virtual Audio Cable default. @zmerp #2861\n* Change SteamVR startup process and remove driver registration modes. @zmerp #2754 #2755 #2875, @curoviyxru #2766\n* Add controller pose correction per-headset. @zmerp  #2751\n* Fix eye alignment on Play For Dream. @shinyquagsire23 #2814 \n* Fix Play For Dream controller velocity. @shinyquagsire23 #2820 \n* Fix missing elbow trackers. @CaveJohnson376 #2870 \n* Fix SteamVR launch fail when using USB mode. @Meister1593 @The-personified-devil @zmerp #2757 \n* Fix firewall rules script on Linux. @Meister1593 #2845\n* Potentially fix SteamVR startup on Linux/Nvidia. @Meister1593 #2844\n* Fix custom installation variables handling on Linux. @The-personified-devil #2800\n* Fix dashboard theme being broken sometimes. @zmerp #2763\n* Other dashboard improvements. @zmerp #2750, @Meister1593 #2840", "created_date": 1751264940, "id": "23997569996546746", "version": "20.14.0", "version_code": 18091520, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7674846229245715", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "23997569996546746"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "809758320719109"}]}, "change_log": "* Add PlayForDream MR support (by @shinyquagsire23 #2713)\n* Add Snapdragon Game Super Resolution (by @zeroxoneafour #2723)\n  * This is still in beta and disabled by default\n* Add RGB and HSV chroma key passthrough (by @zmerp #2662 #2703)\n* Add Pico and Focus Vision face tracking support (by @curoviyxru #2666, @zmerp #2695)\n  * Download the latest VRCFaceTracking ALVR module to use this!\n* Add Pico body tracking support (by @curoviyxru #2674 #2712)\n* Add Pico 4 controller emulation (by @jarettmillard #2724)\n* Better Pico 4 Ultra and G3 controller support (by @curoviyxru #2671 #2679)\n* Add Android launcher icon (by @curoviyxru #2668)\n* Fix judder in certain situations (by @shinyquagsire23 #2660)\n* Fix running ALVR on Intel GPUs on Linux (by @Meister1593 #2664)\n* Auto unblock ALVR driver on Linux (by @skryvel #2708)\n* Some dashboard improvements (by @Meister1593 #2704)", "created_date": 1741706749, "id": "9432622693468051", "version": "20.13.0", "version_code": 18091264, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7674846229245715", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "23997569996546746"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "809758320719109"}]}, "change_log": "* Fix protocol break with client v20.12.0 and older server (by @zmerp #2637)\n* Fix crash on Quest 2 (by @zmerp #2654)\n* Build against GLIBC 2.35 on Linux (by @The-personified-devil #2638)\n* Add \"Enforce server frame pacing\" while keeping GPU deadlock fix (by @zmerp #2632, @shinyquagsire23 #2634)\n* Better fix for Pico and Vive tracking (by @zmerp #2633)\n* Add Max prediction setting (by @zmerp #2635)\n* Update controller tracking prediction default (by @zmerp #2643)\n* Improve GPU dashboard checks on Linux (by @Meister1593 @The-personified-devil #2648)", "created_date": 1737315748, "id": "9136013183129005", "version": "20.12.1", "version_code": 18091009, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7674846229245715", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "23997569996546746"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "809758320719109"}]}, "change_log": "* Add integrated wired mode support (by @E1int #2451)\n  * No more need to open ports and/or changing settings and/or using external software\n  * The client is automatically launched when wired mode is enabled and the headset is connected with the USB cable\n* Add passthrough support for lobby and streaming (by @zmerp #2485 #2527)\n  * For now we support only transparency modes, chroma keying is coming soon\n* Add Quest 3S, Pico 4 Ultra, Vive Focus Vision support (by @zmerp #2466 #2470 #2479)\n* Add Quest Pro and SteamVR hands emulation mode (by @shinyquagsire23 #2489)\n* Add Nvidia AV1 support on Windows (by @shinyquagsire23 #2438)\n* Fix grayish blacks (by @shinyquagsire23 #2597)\n* Add Virtual Audio Cable support (by @DevanWolf #2483)\n* Fix tilt mode origin (by @zmerp)\n* Add VMC support (by @grillo-delmal #2461)\n* Fix gestures being triggered when using multimodal or joycons with Apple Vision Pro (by @zmerp #2606)\n* Some fixes for head and controllers tracking (by @zmerp #2577 #2608)\n* Clarify distinction between bitrate and throughput in the dashboard graphs (by @zmerp #2423)\n* Launch client when installing with launcher (by @E1int #2531)\n* Fix launcher PPI on Steam Deck (by @Vixea #2585)\n* Fix dashboard and launcher positioning on Wayland (by @Kirottu #2595)\n* Add reprojection support on SteamVR/Windows (by @shinyquagsire23 #2472)\n* Fix IDR resend (by @Vixea #2403)\n* Fix high system resources usage before streaming (by @shinyquagsire23 #2495)\n* Fix firmware rules on Linux (by @storfors #2457)\n* Ignore \"Overlapped IO\" error (by @zmerp #2522)\n* Negotiate some image calibration settings (by @shinyquagsire23 #2442)\n* Fix crash on Focus 3 (by @zmerp #2440)\n* Lots of refactoring, CI and wiki changes", "created_date": 1736970624, "id": "9113409568722700", "version": "20.12.0", "version_code": 18091008, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7674846229245715", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "23997569996546746"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "809758320719109"}]}, "change_log": "* Fix hand tracking throwing momentum (by @shinyquagsire23 #2416)\n* Fix hand tracking not working on \"Disabled\" Hand tracking interaction (by @zarik5 #2413)\n* Fix face tracking on Quest Pro (by @zarik5 #2391)\n* Fix blank right eye view with FFE off (by @zarik5 #2397)\n* Fix IDRs on Linux/software encoding (by @The-personified-devil #2405)\n* Make Flatpack package build latest launcher (by @failboat78 #2383)", "created_date": 1726966514, "id": "8383379248392406", "version": "20.11.1", "version_code": 18090753, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}